    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The volume constraint is $ V = \\pi r^2 h = 10 $.  \nThe cost function is $ C = 2(2\\pi r^2) + 1.5(2\\pi r h) = 4\\pi r^2 + 3\\pi r h $.  \nSubstituting $ h = \\frac{10}{\\pi r^2} $ into the cost function and minimizing gives $ r \\approx 1.061 $, $ h \\approx 2.828 $.  \n\n\\boxed{A}",
