      "generated_answer": "Using the recurrence relation $ y[n] = 3y[n-1] - 2y[n-2] $ with initial conditions $ y[0] = 2 $, $ y[1] = 3 $:\n\n- $ y[2] = 3(3) - 2(2) = 9 - 4 = 5 $\n- $ y[3] = 3(5) - 2(3) = 15 - 6 = 9 $\n- $ y[4] = 3(9) - 2(5) = 27 - 10 = 17 $\n\nThus, the sequence for $ n \\geq 2 $ is $ 5, 9, 17, \\ldots $\n\n\\boxed{B}",
