    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "\\boxed{A}  \nThe study successfully developed a porcine model for retroperitoneoscopic nephrectomy, demonstrating its feasibility and utility. Statistical analysis confirmed a learning curve of eight cases, indicating effective skill acquisition. Thus, a reliable training model exists for practicing this procedure.",
