    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "Salvatore has to leave town for military service. His departure follows his failed romance with Elena and precedes Alfredo\u2019s urging for him to pursue his destiny elsewhere. As Alfredo advises, Salvatore leaves Giancaldo permanently without looking back.  \n\n\\boxed{Salvatore}",
