      "generated_answer": "Dr. Capa travels to Los Angeles to restart his life after falling into a deep depression following his patient\u2019s suicide.  \nHe stays with his friend, Dr. Bob Moore, a fellow therapist and author, who invites him to observe a group therapy session.  \nThis move sets the stage for the mystery surrounding Moore\u2019s murder.  \n\n\\boxed{\\text{To restart his life after his patient's suicide and stay with his friend Dr. Bob Moore.}}",
